<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Subscript, Superscript & Preformatted Text Example</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>HTML Subscript, Superscript & Preformatted Text</h1>
  <p>
    Water formula is: H<sub>2</sub>O  
  </p>
    Square of a number: x<sup>2</sup>  
  </p>
  <p>
    Chemical formula of Sulphuric acid: H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub><br>
    10<sup>3</sup> = 1000
  </p>
  <hr>
  <h2>Example of &lt;pre&gt; Tag</h2>
  <pre>
This is preformatted text.
    It keeps spaces,
line breaks,
      and indentation as it is.
  </pre>
</body>
</html>
